    "tests/test_failures.py::test_review_request_changes_hold_is_code_defect: passes: failure_kind returns 'code_defect' for an execute task held 'review request_changes: <review id> (request_changes)' with a rejecting review (verdict request_changes, one comment with path and issue) and no resume_hint.failures; returns 'unknown' for the same hold with no review rows; returns 'invalid_spec' when the rejecting comment says the spec contradicts itself",
    "tests/test_daemon.py::test_auto_fix_round_on_review_hold_without_test_ids: passes: auto_fix_round files exactly one fix round (inputs include the rejecting review id, spec contains the comment text) for a task held 'review request_changes: <id>' with no resume_hint.failures whose rejecting comment path is in scope; with the comment path out of scope no round is filed and the hold is escalated as today",
    ".claude/hooks/tests-green.sh wt/THIS-TASK exits 0"
